+ * exec-stand-in=PATH (default /private/var/ngpu/bin/unixnu-absentd): when that program exists, a denied daemon's exec runs it instead
+ * (exec_activate_image), as the daemon's launchd job; it takes the job's Mach services and closes every connection, so a client gets
