+	/*
+	 * The SystemOS volume union-mounted over the root volume stands in for the root volume, which on macOS is never a union
+	 * (macOS-DroidVM 0038). Kexts do not see MNT_UNION on it: Sandbox evaluates (file-attribute union-mounted-filesystem) with
